<div class="realmusic-head"><span class="rm-tag">Hear it in a historical performance</span></div>
<p class="rm-intro"><em>“The pulse keeps moving evenly while the phrase changes its distance from those expected points.”</em></p>
<section class="example" aria-labelledby="jazz-groove-title">
    <div class="heading">
      <h3 id="jazz-groove-title">Groove — pulse and lean</h3>
      <span class="source">Golden Gate Orchestra, <em>The Charleston</em> (1925) · 26.25 sec.</span>
    </div>
    <audio id="jazz-groove-audio" controls preload="metadata">
      <source src="/guides/modernism-listening/blues-jazz/audio/historical/charleston--pulse-and-lean.m4a" type="audio/mp4">
    </audio>
    <svg id="jazz-groove-stage" class="stage" viewBox="0 0 760 230" role="img" aria-labelledby="jazz-groove-svg-title jazz-groove-svg-desc">
      <title id="jazz-groove-svg-title">Pulse and phrase moving forward as related streams</title>
      <desc id="jazz-groove-svg-desc">A lower stream of evenly spaced pulse points and an upper stream of connected phrase accents travel together. Light connectors show when a phrase accent aligns with a pulse or shifts nearer to the space between pulses.</desc>
      <defs><clipPath id="jazz-groove-window"><rect x="92" y="28" width="636" height="158"></rect></clipPath></defs>
      <text class="muted-label" x="18" y="76">phrase</text>
      <text class="muted-label" x="18" y="158">pulse</text>
      <line class="structure" x1="92" y1="154" x2="728" y2="154"></line>
      <g id="jazz-groove-stream" clip-path="url(#jazz-groove-window)" aria-hidden="true"></g>
